#: src/temperament.c:844
msgid ""
"Your vital energy functions in perfect thermal equilibrium, blending Air and "
"Water. This grants a deeply flexible, empathetic, and highly social persona. "
"The talkative mind flows smoothly with natural emotional sensitivity, "
